  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to the Establishment of an Independent Commission Against Corruption (ICAC) - Short Term Technical Assistance</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;The objective of the contract is to provide a full assessment of the legislative, institutional and operational implications of the establishment of ICAC, the identification of the risks and vulnerabilities and the description of the step-by-step process on how to improve the PNG anti-corruption strategy.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
